  "body": "Five audited fixes, five commits:\n\n1. **Responses usage seeds from message_start** — input_tokens stopped reporting 0 (probe-confirmed).\n2. **env migrations write atomically** — tmp+os.replace mirrors the repo convention; unterminated-quote files skip with a warning (probe showed phantom keys inside quoted values).\n3. **TXT export stops clipping cells** at 40 chars against its own fidelity contract; >40-char regression added.\n4. **extra_body honored on every chat profile** — loud rejecters (kimi/zai/kimi_coding) keep explicit refusal; cohere keeps its allowlist merge.\n5. **Executor telemetry**: client cancellations publish the attempt ledger as `interrupted`; post-commit route-ends mark downstream entries; cooldown step-over gains a 5s floor (live rows showed \"for 0s\"); docstring truthing; RouteExecutionPolicy defaults pinned by test.\n\n§158 note: the briefed \"capture-order fix\" had no audit item behind it — inspected, found correct as-is, changed nothing.\n\nVerification: 8 mutations caught-by-name; whole touched suites green (192 responses + execution + migrations + export); ruff/ty clean. MINOR slot **5.55.0**.\n\nResidual risks: extra_body is a deliberate wire change on profiles that previously dropped it — canonical-field validation still guards collisions.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
