    "message": "fix: cross-surface correctness batch — responses usage seed, atomic migrations, TXT fidelity, extra_body everywhere, executor telemetry\n\nSquash of five audited fixes (see lane history): responses usage seeds\nfrom message_start; env migrations write atomically and skip\nunterminated-quote files; TXT export stops clipping cells at 40 chars;\ncaller extra_body honored on every chat profile (metadata no longer\ntreated as a canonical override -- no encoder writes it); executor\npublishes interrupted-attempt ledgers, marks post-commit route-ends,\nfloors cooldown skips at 5s, pins RouteExecutionPolicy defaults.\nVersion slot 5.55.0.",
